418:         for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) line(ctx, x + 7 + i * (w - 14) / 2, y + 3, x + 7 + i * (w - 14) / 2, y + h - 3, 'rgba(123,132,121,0.32)', 2);
419:         for (let i = 12; i < h - 8; i += 34) {
420:           ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${55 + v * 30},${50 + v * 20},${38},0.8)`;
421:           ctx.fillRect(x + 8, y + i, w - 18, 18);
422:         }
423:       }
424:       break;
425:     }
426:     case 'bench': {
427:       shadow(ctx, p, 5);
428:       ctx.fillStyle = '#343a33';
429:       ctx.fillRect(x, y, w, h);
430:       ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(180,184,165,0.12)';
431:       ctx.fillRect(x + 4, y + 3, w - 8, 2);
432:       ctx.strokeStyle = '#111513';
433:       ctx.strokeRect(x + 1, y + 1, w - 2, h - 2);
